{"seq":3,"slug":"electrolysis-plating","title":"电解与电镀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/electrolysis-plating","wordCount":1642,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电解与电镀\">电解与电镀</h1><p>如果说电池是让自发反应「顺着」发电，那么电解就是逆天而行——外加电源强迫不自发的反应发生，把电能塞进化学键里。人类用电解从矿石中提取了铝、从盐水里制出了烧碱与氯气、在廉价金属上镀出光亮的铬层。这些工业过程每年消耗全球电力的相当一部分，背后是同一套规律：<a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">电化学池与法拉第定律</a> 决定了产量与能耗。本篇讲清电解的电压构成、几个支柱性的工业电解过程、以及电镀如何把法拉第定律做成可控的镀层厚度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电解在 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">电解池</a> 中进行：外加电源把正极接阳极（发生氧化）、负极接阴极（发生还原），强迫 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的非自发反应进行。阴极上发生还原（金属沉积、析氢等），阳极上发生氧化（金属溶解、析氧、析氯等）。哪种物质优先在电极上反应，由其 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a> 和动力学（超电势）共同决定——这就是「放电顺序」问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[外加直流电源] --&gt; B[阴极: 还原]&#10;  A --&gt; C[阳极: 氧化]&#10;  B --&gt; D[金属沉积/析氢]&#10;  C --&gt; E[金属溶解/析氧析氯]&#10;  D --&gt; F[放电顺序&lt;br/&gt;由电势+超电势决定]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[产量: 法拉第定律]&#10;  F --&gt; H[能耗: 槽电压×电荷]\">flowchart TD\n  A[外加直流电源] --&gt; B[阴极: 还原]\n  A --&gt; C[阳极: 氧化]\n  B --&gt; D[金属沉积/析氢]\n  C --&gt; E[金属溶解/析氧析氯]\n  D --&gt; F[放电顺序&lt;br/&gt;由电势+超电势决定]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[产量: 法拉第定律]\n  F --&gt; H[能耗: 槽电压×电荷]</pre><p>下表列出几个支柱性工业电解过程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>阴极产物</th>\n<th>阳极产物</th>\n<th>工业意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电解水</td>\n<td>氢气</td>\n<td>氧气</td>\n<td>绿氢制备、储能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氯碱工业</td>\n<td>氢气 + 烧碱</td>\n<td>氯气</td>\n<td>基础化工原料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝电解（霍尔-埃鲁）</td>\n<td>铝</td>\n<td>二氧化碳</td>\n<td>全球铝来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜电解精炼</td>\n<td>高纯铜</td>\n<td>粗铜溶解</td>\n<td>电缆用高纯铜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电镀</td>\n<td>镀层金属沉积</td>\n<td>金属溶解/析氧</td>\n<td>表面处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分解电压与槽电压-能耗从哪来\">分解电压与槽电压：能耗从哪来</h2><p>要让电解发生，外加电压必须超过一个最小值——理论分解电压，它等于阴阳极两个反应平衡电位之差（即对应原电池的电动势）。但实际所需的「槽电压」远高于此，多出来的部分全是损耗：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>槽</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>理论</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>溶液</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\text{槽}} = E_{\\text{理论}} + |\\eta_a| + |\\eta_c| + IR_{\\text{溶液}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">槽</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">理论</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">溶液</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后三项分别是阳极超电势、阴极超电势（即 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 里的活化过电位）和溶液欧姆压降（<a href=\"../kinetics/mass-transport-polarization\">传质与极化</a> 里的欧姆极化）。电解能耗的优化，本质就是压低这三项：用高活性电极催化剂降超电势、用高电导电解液和小极间距降欧姆压降。以电解水为例，理论分解电压仅 1.23 V，但实际槽电压常达 1.8~2.0 V，多出的近 0.6 V 几乎全是过电位和欧姆损耗——这就是为什么电解水制氢的能效提升空间主要在催化剂和膜上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放电顺序与析氢-析氧超电势\">放电顺序与析氢/析氧超电势</h2><p>电解水溶液时，电极上往往有多个候选反应竞争，到底谁先反应？原则上电势更有利者优先，但超电势会改写这个排序——这正是 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 在工业上最有力的体现。</p>\n<p>经典例子是氯碱工业电解饱和食盐水。从标准电势看，阳极上水的氧化（析氧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⊖</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.23</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^{\\ominus} \\approx 1.23\\,\\mathrm{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊖</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.23</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>）比氯离子氧化（析氯，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⊖</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.36</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^{\\ominus} \\approx 1.36\\,\\mathrm{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊖</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.36</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>）更容易，理论上应该析氧。但氧气在工业电极上的析出超电势极高，而氯气的析出超电势很低，实际结果是氯气优先析出——整个氯碱工业能成立，全靠这个动力学反转。同理，电镀锌、镀镍能在阴极顺利沉积金属而非大量析氢，也得益于这些金属在阴极的析氢超电势较高，抑制了氢气的竞争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电镀-把法拉第定律做成厚度\">电镀：把法拉第定律做成厚度</h2><p>电镀是 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">法拉第定律</a> 最精细的工程应用。把待镀工件作阴极、镀层金属（或惰性电极）作阳极，浸入含镀层金属离子的电解液，通电后金属离子在工件表面还原沉积。镀层质量由法拉第定律精确控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>I</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>F</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>电流</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\frac{I\\,t}{F}\\cdot\\frac{M}{n}\\cdot\\eta_{\\text{电流}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">电流</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>电流</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{电流}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">电流</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是电流效率（<a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">法拉第定律</a> 里的概念），扣除了析氢等副反应分流的电荷。已知镀液金属浓度、工件面积和目标厚度，就能反推所需的电流和时间。但实际电镀的难点不在总量，而在均匀性——工件凸起处电流密度高、镀得厚，凹陷和深孔处电流密度低、镀得薄，这种「电流分布不均」直接来自 <a href=\"../kinetics/mass-transport-polarization\">传质与极化</a> 里的极化效应。改善办法是添加整平剂、优化镀液「分散能力」、设计辅助阳极。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工业电解的规模与前沿\">工业电解的规模与前沿</h2><p>铝电解（霍尔-埃鲁法）是电解工业的能耗巨兽：在约 960°C 的熔融冰晶石中电解氧化铝，每生产 1 吨铝约耗电 13000~15000 kWh，全球电解铝消耗的电力占人类总用电的可观比例。降低能耗、用惰性阳极替代消耗性碳阳极（避免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 排放）是该领域的长期目标。</p>\n<p>电解水制氢则是 2026 年能源转型的焦点。用可再生电力电解水产「绿氢」，是消纳过剩风光电、实现工业脱碳的关键路径。质子交换膜（PEM）电解槽和碱性电解槽是两大主流技术，前者响应快、适配波动电源但依赖贵金属催化剂，后者成本低但动态性差——这与 <a href=\"../batteries/fuel-cell-supercap\">燃料电池与超级电容</a> 里燃料电池面临的催化剂难题恰好是同一枚硬币的两面（电解是燃料电池的逆过程）。可逆的「电解-燃料电池」一体化装置，正成为长时储能的重要候选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电解在电解池中靠外加电源强迫非自发反应：阴极还原、阳极氧化，放电顺序由电极电势与超电势共同决定。</li>\n<li>槽电压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>槽</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>理论</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\text{槽}} = E_{\\text{理论}} + |\\eta_a| + |\\eta_c| + IR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">槽</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">理论</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，超出理论分解电压的部分是过电位与欧姆损耗，是节能优化的着力点。</li>\n<li>析氢/析氧超电势能改写放电顺序：氯碱工业靠析氧超电势高才使氯气优先，金属电沉积靠析氢超电势抑制氢气竞争。</li>\n<li>电镀用法拉第定律精确控制镀层质量（含电流效率），难点在电流分布不均导致的厚度不均，靠整平剂与镀液分散能力改善。</li>\n<li>铝电解是能耗巨兽（每吨约 13000~15000 kWh）；电解水制绿氢是 2026 能源转型焦点，是燃料电池的逆过程，可逆一体化装置成长时储能候选。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电解与电镀","id":"电解与电镀"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分解电压与槽电压：能耗从哪来","id":"分解电压与槽电压-能耗从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"放电顺序与析氢/析氧超电势","id":"放电顺序与析氢-析氧超电势"},{"level":2,"text":"电镀：把法拉第定律做成厚度","id":"电镀-把法拉第定律做成厚度"},{"level":2,"text":"工业电解的规模与前沿","id":"工业电解的规模与前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"腐蚀与防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/corrosion-protection"},"next":null}